WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Keep your agents
in one small window.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Claude Code + Codex,
in one place.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Running, needs you,
or ready to check.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Scroll through
what came back.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
A short report
on each card.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Click to open
the conversation.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Star it to keep
it at the top.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Checked it?
Mark it Dealt with.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Off your list—until
your next request.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Expand to see
all your projects.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Separate conversations,
grouped by project.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Keep the goal
in a project note.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:56.000
github.com/laurenceholt/kanbanana
